    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>STRANGER'S WORLDS</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stranded in an unknown planet filled with  creatures and environments from outside worlds, you will need to survive and collect the alien artefacts that linked to this cause to unveil the mysteries.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408670/extras/a8dca38eef85e1656a69efc780f975ca.poster.avif?t=1747757856\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408670/extras/a8dca38eef85e1656a69efc780f975ca.webm?t=1747757856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408670/extras/a8dca38eef85e1656a69efc780f975ca.mp4?t=1747757856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>EXPLORE THE MYSTERIOUS ISLANDS ACROSS THE SEA</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chunks of land that have been summoned from different worlds have collided in this planet. You will need to build a ship as your moving fortress to explore across the sea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408670/extras/7fbae84ddf8756118c2dfc16dfe097c8.poster.avif?t=1747757856\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408670/extras/7fbae84ddf8756118c2dfc16dfe097c8.webm?t=1747757856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408670/extras/7fbae84ddf8756118c2dfc16dfe097c8.mp4?t=1747757856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>BUILD BASES WITH SURVIVORS</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and raise your bases with the survivors you met along the way to settle and shelter them from hostile inhabitants and harsh environments.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408670/extras/6b6d3523e1c12b5ca822ea36c14c22b8.poster.avif?t=1747757856\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408670/extras/6b6d3523e1c12b5ca822ea36c14c22b8.webm?t=1747757856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408670/extras/6b6d3523e1c12b5ca822ea36c14c22b8.mp4?t=1747757856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>SURVIVAL</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather raw materials and build workstations to craft weapons, armors, tools, cook foods, grow crops and make potions to help you survive and fight throughout the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>GAIN EXPERIENCE</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you survive longer, your character will gain experience and be able to learn new skills to\u00a0 build the character you desire such as battle mage, gunner mage, alchemist, firearms expert, melee expert and many other builds depending on the perks combo of your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>KEY FEATURES:-</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunger and Thirst does not give any consequences, however eating and drinking gives bonus stats instead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic skill perks allow your character to have multiple builds suiting your play styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse weapons ranging from Melee, firearms to magic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Damage status includes physical (Blunt, Slash, Puncture) and elemental (Fire, Ice, Radiation, Electric, Poison).\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ships built can have workstations and other equipment onboard that could aid players as you sail across the sea.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New craftables can be attained by discovering its blueprints found throughout the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many magic that can be learned and acquired throughout the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survivors can be assigned at your base to do various tasks such as farming, hunting, mining, research, building ships, maintaining structures, cooking and many more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can build up to 3 Bases and assign which survivors you've met to settle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>STRANGER'S WORLDS</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stranded in an unknown planet filled with  creatures and environments from outside worlds, you will need to survive and collect the alien artefacts that linked to this cause to unveil the mysteries.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408670/extras/a8dca38eef85e1656a69efc780f975ca.poster.avif?t=1747757856\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408670/extras/a8dca38eef85e1656a69efc780f975ca.webm?t=1747757856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408670/extras/a8dca38eef85e1656a69efc780f975ca.mp4?t=1747757856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>EXPLORE THE MYSTERIOUS ISLANDS ACROSS THE SEA</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chunks of land that have been summoned from different worlds have collided in this planet. You will need to build a ship as your moving fortress to explore across the sea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408670/extras/7fbae84ddf8756118c2dfc16dfe097c8.poster.avif?t=1747757856\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408670/extras/7fbae84ddf8756118c2dfc16dfe097c8.webm?t=1747757856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408670/extras/7fbae84ddf8756118c2dfc16dfe097c8.mp4?t=1747757856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>BUILD BASES WITH SURVIVORS</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and raise your bases with the survivors you met along the way to settle and shelter them from hostile inhabitants and harsh environments.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408670/extras/6b6d3523e1c12b5ca822ea36c14c22b8.poster.avif?t=1747757856\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408670/extras/6b6d3523e1c12b5ca822ea36c14c22b8.webm?t=1747757856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408670/extras/6b6d3523e1c12b5ca822ea36c14c22b8.mp4?t=1747757856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>SURVIVAL</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather raw materials and build workstations to craft weapons, armors, tools, cook foods, grow crops and make potions to help you survive and fight throughout the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>GAIN EXPERIENCE</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you survive longer, your character will gain experience and be able to learn new skills to\u00a0 build the character you desire such as battle mage, gunner mage, alchemist, firearms expert, melee expert and many other builds depending on the perks combo of your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>KEY FEATURES:-</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunger and Thirst does not give any consequences, however eating and drinking gives bonus stats instead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic skill perks allow your character to have multiple builds suiting your play styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse weapons ranging from Melee, firearms to magic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Damage status includes physical (Blunt, Slash, Puncture) and elemental (Fire, Ice, Radiation, Electric, Poison).\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ships built can have workstations and other equipment onboard that could aid players as you sail across the sea.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New craftables can be attained by discovering its blueprints found throughout the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many magic that can be learned and acquired throughout the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survivors can be assigned at your base to do various tasks such as farming, hunting, mining, research, building ships, maintaining structures, cooking and many more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can build up to 3 Bases and assign which survivors you've met to settle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Stranded in an anomalous planet containing various environments from other worlds that have collided. Utilize what different worlds can offer within, such as magic and technology. Gather, craft, survive and explore with up to 4 players throughout the journey.",
